            </h3>

            <p>
              Te ayudamos con errores de uso del sistema y enseñamos su funcionamiento.
            </p>

            <div class="support-phone">

              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">
                Whatsapp
              </span>

              <span>
                <a href="https://wa.me/573163977448?text=Buen%20día%2C%20necesito%20soporte.%0A%0AMi%20nombre%20es%3A%0ADe%20la%20empresa%3A%0ADe%20la%20ciudad%3A%0ALa%20falla%20o%20el%20requerimiento%20es%3A"
                  target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration: none; color: #082f49;">
                  +57 316 3977448</a>

              </span>

            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- CARD ADMINISTRATIVO -->
          <div class="support-card">

            <div class="support-icon">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">
                <svg width="25" height="25" viewBox="0 0 298.5 298.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <path
                    d="M141.44 148.946L174.24 136.413C167.136 130.474 159.085 125.662 150.359 122.234C140.288 128.731 128.83 132.202 116.818 132.202C104.806 132.202 93.348 128.731 83.277 122.234C54.725 133.451 33.323 159.433 29.075 191.449L21.201 250.802C20.658 254.893 21.907 259.02 24.626 262.123C27.345 265.227 31.272 267.007 35.399 267.007H142.942C130.146 242.956 120.984 212.953 118.361 186.28C116.77 170.099 126.26 154.747 141.44 148.946Z"
