            </div>

            <h3>
              Area Administrativa
            </h3>

            <p>
              ¿Quieres agendar alguna cita? U dudas administrativas. Aqui te podemos ayudar!
            </p>

            <div class="support-phone">

              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">
                Whatsapp
              </span>

              <span>
                <a href="https://wa.me/573172277990?text=Hola,%20mi%20nombre%20es:%20%0A%0AMe%20comunico%20de%20la%20empresa:%20%0A%0AY%20requiero%20informaci%C3%B3n%20sobre:%20"
                  target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration: none; color: #082f49;">
                  +57 317 2277990</a>

              </span>

            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- CARD CARTERA-->
          <div class="support-card">

            <div class="support-icon">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <path
                    d="M2 20C1.45 20 0.979167 19.8042 0.5875 19.4125C0.195833 19.0208 0 18.55 0 18V7C0 6.45 0.195833 5.97917 0.5875 5.5875C0.979167 5.19583 1.45 5 2 5H7V2C7 1.45 7.19583 0.979167 7.5875 0.5875C7.97917 0.195833 8.45 0 9 0H11C11.55 0 12.0208 0.195833 12.4125 0.5875C12.8042 0.979167 13 1.45 13 2V5H18C18.55 5 19.0208 5.19583 19.4125 5.5875C19.8042 5.97917 20 6.45 20 7V18C20 18.55 19.8042 19.0208 19.4125 19.4125C19.0208 19.8042 18.55 20 18 20H2V20M2 18H18V18V18V7V7V7H13V7C13 7.55 12.8042 8.02083 12.4125 8.4125C12.0208 8.80417 11.55 9 11 9H9C8.45 9 7.97917 8.80417 7.5875 8.4125C7.19583 8.02083 7 7.55 7 7V7H2V7V7V18V18V18V18M4 16H10V15.55C10 15.2667 9.92083 15.0042 9.7625 14.7625C9.60417 14.5208 9.38333 14.3333 9.1 14.2C8.76667 14.05 8.42917 13.9375 8.0875 13.8625C7.74583 13.7875 7.38333 13.75 7 13.75C6.61667 13.75 6.25417 13.7875 5.9125 13.8625C5.57083 13.9375 5.23333 14.05 4.9 14.2C4.61667 14.3333 4.39583 14.5208 4.2375 14.7625C4.07917 15.0042 4 15.2667 4 15.55V16V16M12 14.5H16V13H12V14.5V14.5M7 13C7.41667 13 7.77083 12.8542 8.0625 12.5625C8.35417 12.2708 8.5 11.9167 8.5 11.5C8.5 11.0833 8.35417 10.7292 8.0625 10.4375C7.77083 10.1458 7.41667 10 7 10C6.58333 10 6.22917 10.1458 5.9375 10.4375C5.64583 10.7292 5.5 11.0833 5.5 11.5C5.5 11.9167 5.64583 12.2708 5.9375 12.5625C6.22917 12.8542 6.58333 13 7 13V13M12 11.5H16V10H12V11.5V11.5M9 7H11V2H9V7V7M10 12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5"
